From 699293e1d8c0de27c11600e8149cc29bd0910a19 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: iimmyy <i.a.martins001@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 00:33:17 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 24/30] ggml-hexagon: co-op prompt reading (LG_COOP=1): the NPU
 computes a share of each big matmul from its tiles while the CPU computes the
 rest from a repacked copy and runs every other op; reading 16 -> 38.5 tok/s
 (CPU alone 37.8), KL vs CPU 0.003; decode stays NPU-only

---
 ggml/src/ggml-hexagon/CMakeLists.txt   |   2 +-
 ggml/src/ggml-hexagon/ggml-hexagon.cpp | 166 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 ggml/src/ggml-hexagon/htp/lg-q2k-ops.c |  37 +++++-
 3 files changed, 202 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

